						<h1>My DevOps Project Manager</h1>
						<p>Project Hub is a lightweight, portfolio-oriented platform designed as a simplified alternative to GitHub. It allows users to upload and showcase their software projects, while also browsing and viewing others' work. Ideal for students, developers, and freelancers, Project Hub serves as a centralized space to present personal or team projects in a clean and accessible format. Whether you're building a professional portfolio or just sharing progress, Project Hub makes it easy to manage and display your work.</p>
					</div>
